Spec: Cross-platform standard server authority conformance

Purpose:
  Verify independently implemented .NET and Java receivers against actual Go-issued JWS and public device certificates.

Owns:
  ./verify.ps1
  ./README.md

Structure:
  ./java: Independent Java lease receiver without server private keys or authority storage.

Must:
  Build all fixtures before issuing short-lived tokens and keep every generated token in protected ignored artifacts.
  Verify correct signature/scope plus signed malformed claims and monotonic lifecycle cases, without cloud or installed runtime changes.
